NOTICE: attribution for the kafka-sre-27b-v2-retrieval-only adapter

This directory holds a LoRA adapter (adapters.safetensors, adapter_config.json). It was trained on
question-and-answer pairs that a language model wrote from the documentation of the projects listed
below, at the pins given. The adapter contains no copy of that documentation. For every source below
the pages were converted to plain text (Markdown, AsciiDoc or HTML to text with headings), cleaned
(front matter, comments, images, shortcodes, includes and link markup removed; AsciiDoc attributes
expanded) and split into excerpts. A language model (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash) wrote question-and-answer
pairs from single excerpts; a verifier model checked them against the excerpt and some pairs were
filtered out; the remaining pairs (8,039 train rows) were used to fine-tune the adapter. The adapter
is not endorsed by the projects named here.

The adapter is applied at load time to Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B. It is meant to be used only with retrieved
documentation excerpts in the prompt (see README.md).

